 says flag ("1" or "0"). Could just compare after trimming. Probably fine.

Better to trim pinnedFlag? Might be safer to use .trimmingCharacters(in: .whitespaces
AndNewlines). But spec doesn't mention. I'd keep strict.

Also id, title, body might have leading/trailing whitespace? Probably keep as is.

